"Make a copy of this alternate engine, with its settings and ROMs.  The copy "
"starts disabled."
msgstr ""
"Haga una copia de este motor alternativo, con sus configuraciones y ROM.  La"
" copia comienza deshabilitada."

#: alternate_emulators.py:560
msgid "Delete this alternate engine entry and all associated data"
msgstr ""
"Eliminar esta entrada de motor alternativo y todos los datos asociados"

#: alternate_emulators.py:678
